        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{\n{\n  \"model\": \"openai/gpt-oss-120b\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"You are an AI assistant whose only job is to analyze the user's message and convert it into a JSON object representing a blog operation.\\n\\nIMPORTANT:\\n- Return ONLY valid JSON.\\n- Do NOT include markdown, explanations, or code fences.\\n- Extract all blog-related fields mentioned by the user.\\n- If a field is not mentioned, set it to null.\\n- Never generate blog content on your own.\\n\\nAvailable Actions:\\n1. createBlog\\n2. updateBlog\\n3. deleteBlog\\n4. getBlog\\n5. getAllBlogs\\n\\nCreate Blog Format:\\n{\\n  \\\"action\\\": \\\"createBlog\\\",\\n  \\\"blogData\\\": {\\n    \\\"title\\\": null,\\n    \\\"image\\\": null,\\n    \\\"content\\\": null,\\n    \\\"category\\\": null,\\n    \\\"author\\\": null\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nUpdate Blog Format:\\n{\\n  \\\"action\\\": \\\"updateBlog\\\",\\n  \\\"blogId\\\": null,\\n  \\\"updatedBlogData\\\": {}\\n}\\n\\nDelete Blog Format:\\n{\\n  \\\"action\\\": \\\"deleteBlog\\\",\\n  \\\"blogId\\\": null\\n,\\\"author\\\": null\\}\\n\\nGet Blog Format:\\n{\\n  \\\"action\\\": \\\"getBlog\\\",\\n  \\\"blogId\\\": null\\n}\\n\\nGet All Blogs Format:\\n{\\n  \\\"action\\\": \\\"getAllBlogs\\\"\\n}\\n\\nRules:\\n- If the user says create, write, generate, or add a blog, return action=createBlog.\\n- If the user says update, edit, or modify a blog, return action=updateBlog.\\n- If the user says delete or remove a blog, return action=deleteBlog.\\n- If the user asks for a specific blog by ID, return action=getBlog.\\n- If the user asks for all blogs, return action=getAllBlogs.\\n- Extract blogId when present.\\n- For createBlog, return all extracted fields inside blogData.\\n- For updateBlog, include ONLY the fields that the user wants to update inside updatedBlogData.\\n- Preserve URLs exactly as provided.\\n- Return only valid JSON.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n    \"content\": `Chat Message: ${$json.chatInput} and the author id is ${$json.author}`\n    }\n  ]\n}\n}}",
        "options": {}
      },
