        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n\"model\": \"openai/gpt-oss-120b\",\n\"messages\": [\n{\n\"role\": \"system\",\n\"content\": \"You are an expert blog writer and category classifier. Return ONLY valid JSON. Never return markdown code fences. Never return explanations, reasoning, notes, or text outside the JSON object.\"\n},\n{\n\"role\": \"user\",\n\"content\": \"Create a professional blog based on the following topic:\\n\\n{{ $json.title }}\\n\\nUse the image provided: {{ $json.image || '' }}\\n\\nDetermine the most appropriate category and return the corresponding MongoDB ObjectId.\\n\\nCATEGORY MAPPING\\n\\nbitcoin -> 66654c8c123bd0b06327ced2\\ntechnology -> 666772715fe3470824557139\\neducation -> 666772795fe347082455713b\\nscience -> 666772815fe347082455713d\\nhealth -> 666772cb5fe347082455713f\\ntravel -> 666772de5fe3470824557141\\nfood & cooking -> 666772f05fe3470824557143\\nentertainment -> 666773035fe3470824557145\\nbusiness -> 6667731a5fe3470824557149\\nbusiness strategy -> 6667731a5fe3470824557149\\ngym -> 668de2a3ec4c14d6ba035010\\n\\nCLASSIFICATION RULES\\n\\n- AI, Artificial Intelligence, Programming, Software Development, Coding, React, Next.js, Node.js, Web Development, Mobile Development -> technology\\n- Startup, Marketing, Sales, Entrepreneurship, Management, Finance, Investment, Business Growth -> business\\n- Bitcoin, Blockchain, Cryptocurrency, Web3, Crypto Trading -> bitcoin\\n- Fitness, Workout, Bodybuilding, Exercise, Muscle Building, Strength Training -> gym\\n- Diet, Nutrition, Wellness, Medical Topics, Healthcare -> health\\n- School, College, Learning, Courses, Tutorials -> education\\n- Research, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Space, Scientific Discoveries -> science\\n- Tourism, Vacation, Destinations, Hotels, Trips -> travel\\n- Recipes, Cooking, Food Preparation, Restaurants -> food & cooking\\n- Movies, TV Shows, Music, Celebrities, Gaming -> entertainment\\n\\nREQUIREMENTS\\n\\n- Generate an SEO-friendly title.\\n- Write a complete blog article of at least 800 words.\\n- Format the content using Markdown.\\n- Select exactly one category.\\n- Store ONLY the MongoDB ObjectId in the category field.\\n- Use the provided image URL.\\n- Use author: {{ $json.author || 'Admin' }}.\\n- Set createdAt as the current ISO timestamp.\\n\\nIMPORTANT JSON RULES\\n\\n- Return ONLY a JSON object.\\n- No markdown code blocks.\\n- No explanations.\\n- No reasoning.\\n- No notes.\\n- No comments.\\n- No additional fields.\\n- No bold formatting.\\n- No text before or after the JSON.\\n- The response MUST be directly parseable by JSON.parse().\\n\\nExpected JSON structure:\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n  \\\"image\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n  \\\"content\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n  \\\"author\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n  \\\"category\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n  \\\"createdAt\\\": \\\"string\\\"\\n}\"\n}\n]\n}\n",
        "options": {}
      },
